          66.0,
          1070.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "If history is any guide, it's almost certain that advances in AI will cause more jobs to  $ \\underline{35} $ , that creative workers with human-only skills will become richer but fewer in number, and that those who own creative technology will become the new ultra-rich.",
